title: "awesome-stereoscopy: curated resources for stereoscopic 3D"
abstract: "Curated resources for stereoscopic 3D: formats, standards, tools, players, servers, displays, headsets, and 190 years of history, from Wheatstone's 1838 stereoscope to spatial video. Every entry is checked against its source."
